### IPPC ePhyto Hub Delivery Status

The phytosanitary certificate has been sent to the IPPC ePhyto Hub. It shows as `PendingDelivery` until the importing country's NPPO downloads it, then `Delivered`.

- **Reference Number**: `{{ .reference_number }}`
- **ePhyto Reference Number**: `{{ .certificate_id }}`
