You don't have to wait for delivery to choose what to do next. Withdrawing the certificate needs the NPQS officer's approval; once approved, it is withdrawn on the IPPC ePhyto Hub and the NPQS process ends. **Check the delivery status again** asks the Hub for the latest status.
